 * Summary labels rendered into this file as additional taint steps
 * (role=summary, 24 candidates; 13 sink-side + 11 source-side). Each step
 * below exists only because the real source code supports it; there is no
 * unconditional taint propagation.
 *
 * Steps NOT rendered as custom edges (covered by standard data flow, or
 * deliberately left unmodeled):
 *
 *   - parse_url result propagation (labels P3-S-023/027/034/038/044/049/050,
 *     all summary/tp): parse_url is defined inside the database
 *     (cairosvg/url.py:87-129), so argument -> parameter, local flow and
 *     return -> call-result are standard interprocedural data flow. No
 *     hand edge is needed and none is added.
 *   - file_obj.read() (P3-S-048): local flow inside Tree.__init__
 *     (parser.py:359) covers it.
 *   - tinycss2 parse steps (P3-S-026, P3-S-029): tinycss2 object property
 *     flows are untracked; the gap is closed by the source label
